ƒgascribeƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproduct‚fvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark‚fvectorƒhgrounded‚dbasefEntity‚dbasefEntityƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;V4vrb5LkqxE4qYzYGztqYR2FkkB00zx6KFXlDFvN9Csƒdpairƒfvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark˜iƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;V4vrb5LkqxE4qYzYGztqYR2FkkB00zx6KFXlDFvN9Csƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-PxYcwQleL3ZjKG-C0BNshr8aZKiuWvafLS8Y0wKYQ4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxRni:///sha-256;YQgYjWpapNNSLass4p5xAwYt1m5oHVoyf8epvd1raKU.refused-invalid-evidenceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ViF8S44Lz-RICY7fnkMqmf66n9SMZ5sB-JtJU7sglewƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;W805l1drRcMhTWYgTcMv38svbKHsnr8uzfZTYYOEvIYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;z7hra_F0Ah3X_EqpYZDWBPAARo5G5UFxuKLcXYFBNpoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;edTdNcb66VdjTmNpXyADNoGUwUN9VZdWtHqO3Vof_zMƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DcacGHZi615luGcPGIklh9mjXVPuYhzTHg1V3UCxwBQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0uoOiTzJhwX2mxrO6hI3olOZVQ_4nhZs29o-jrTjMuUƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;J8DQzIVV1kkeF0LGdfaP0LYam70hcNtYgzz0RJdJt1wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxclaude-code-cli-invocationsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vsNdRXDgmLKT0qd6WDJsWwerGI4fGbMCQLej2roHH-Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Pin8CpvJTZF-j3t8W8PEgGegNciHnywchHWEezDIeFYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkg300.983ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gdLYcsiecqyrs7gGW_lWKplZ_QZJi7HnUtEvEvtI-yoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxexchange-20260719-223303-d9a00bƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lFY7InkGemBPKJPXC9crXoYz7EeSbBY6gILEI4Th3T0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgrefusalƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Pxyf9wrIQlTTElP8d0103wfTwdi8yD-I9woDF3U6VbMƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;TJOBIPAU06zJR6qYghlmUjErM8GJfXmAh8356opXbGAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd6000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ja98l5ZJQjiZ4Q8nZZaNzREaRFAIamRX47hVmkixVKUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vv-5mgM64eJUSI7k1gGvPgBfLVowIH1LWTYz-_JvnMsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;e3UAvp7g49mrsGiyZDfw3vj9dG5R5rAQzu68qTsgbE8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyÇÔYou hold an independent editorial assessment duty. Do not rewrite the manuscript and d